#: src/main.glade:440
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Giriş açaryňyzy ýa-da girişdäki KWallet-ni awtomatiki açmak üçin ýüz "
"tanamaklygyny işjeňleşdiriň. Bu, parolyňyzy TPM-de möhürlenen ýa-da diňe kök "
"esasy açary ulanyp AES-256-GCM bilen kodlanan parolyňyzy ygtybarly saklaýar. "
"“Face auth” iş stoluňyza baglylykda pam_gnome_keyring ýa-da pam_kwallet5 "
"üçin PAM_AUTHTOK."

