#: src/onboarding.glade:599
msgid "yes"
msgstr "hawa"

#: src/onboarding.glade:616
msgid "no"
msgstr "ýok"

#: src/onboarding.glade:674
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available "
"cameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list of "
"usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and click Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello elýeterli kameralar üçin ulgamyňyzy awtomatiki gözlär, şonuň "
"üçin web kameranyňyzyň birikdirilendigine göz ýetiriň. Ectionüze "
"çykarylandan soň ulanyp boljak web kameralarynyň sanawy görkeziler. Ulanmak "
"isleýän zadyňyzy saýlaň we \"Indiki\" düwmesine basyň."

#: src/onboarding.glade:697
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Web kameralaryňyzy synap görüň, garaşyň ..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:749
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Maglumat faýllaryny göçürip almak"

#: src/onboarding.glade:768
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be able "
"to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the download "
